WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:04.091
Decisions lists every release approval request for your systems.

2
00:00:04.985 --> 00:00:09.806
The filter switches between pending, approved and rejected. Each shows its count.

3
00:00:10.678 --> 00:00:12.257
Click a request to open it.

4
00:00:13.129 --> 00:00:19.998
A pending request is decided on the system file, beside the release gate, by someone other than the person who asked.
